{"id":"vod_zy360_68957","vodId":"68957","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"城市猎人tv版","name_cn":"城市猎人tv版","date":"1987-01-01","year":"1987","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全140期","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241127-1/5465c06e43a8fc073bb78aa383352fcd.jpg"},"summary":"《城市猎人》TV动画共有4部，另有3话TV Special，4部分别是《城市猎人》、《城市猎人2》、《城市猎人3》与《城市猎人&#39;91》，皆为读卖电视台与日升动画制作、日本电视系首播。该漫画在正式连载前，作者北条司先后推出了《城市猎人 - XYZ》以及《城市猎人 - 双刃剑》两篇试验性短篇。因受到高度好评而终于在1985年—1991年期间正式长期连载与集英社旗下的《少年Jump周刊》杂志。该作品以生动幽默的风格描述一位好色、身怀绝技而又有自身缺点、令人可爱又可恨，自称城市清道夫的冴羽獠与他的同伴槙村香所组合的私家侦探事务所的故事。故事中想要联络城市猎人的方法是在新宿的留言板上写上暗号XYZ，如此一来城市猎人就会跟你连络，传说只帮助美女。何谓XYZ呢？XYZ是英文字母中的最后三个字母，意味着后面没了，我已经没有退路了的意思。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-28 13:04:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":140,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第001话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/0pqfYZH1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第002话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/sozRs0QO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第003话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/MBX3XFJ8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第004话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/zrm7o5L5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第005话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/6Zynt8o2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第006话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/Fov5wPGJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第007话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/4f56ikCL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第008话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/c1xlPwEO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第009话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/UeIrAG06/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第010话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/ju99AOBp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第011话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/iYmuIH5N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第012话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/wla5QBn7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第013话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241126/sTNzTUyA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第014话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi